title: El foco
max-visits: 1
view-if: 0
# Container/namespace only — NOT tagged event. The rural foco (PDLP) redesign:
# @forjar (train the band) -> @marcha (the node-to-node war, reached each month by the
# "La columna" card) -> @cerco (the encirclement mini-decision, fires as an event).
# Position is col_prof 0..5 along the coast->deep-sierra axis. Four meters (f_comida,
# f_parque, f_hombres, f_moral) drain monthly in post_event; apoyo_popular is the water.

# =====================================================================
# PHASE 0 — FORJAR EL FOCO (how you train the band). Your first real decision.
# =====================================================================
@forjar
title: Forjar el foco
new-page: true
face-image: img/campfound.jpg
subtitle: Before the first shot, the decision that decides all the others
on-arrival: f_phase = "forjar"

= Forjar el foco

A guerrilla is not declared; it is *forged*, and how you forge it now decides how it dies or wins later. You have a handful of compañeros, a few weapons, the sierra de Atoyac at your back and the whole apparatus of the state in front of you. Che wrote the manual and then died in Bolivia proving that the manual is not enough — that a column cut off from the people is just a group of armed men waiting to be reported. Before the war begins, choose what kind of band this will be.

- @forjar_cuba: **Cuba — la escuela de Bayo.** Send the cadre to Punto Cero, where the old captain who drilled Fidel and Che in Mexico before the Granma is now a general of the Republic, still teaching from his own manual. They come back soldiers. *(+skill, +morale, +discipline, +materiel; costs months, and the airports are watched — the file grows.)*
- @forjar_maestro: **El maestro rural — Lucio's way.** No guns first. Teach, live among, mediate, organize the villages until the water is deep before the war is loud. *(+deep popular support, +recruits from the base; the slowest military start.)*
- @forjar_solos: **Solos, en la sierra.** Train yourselves, in the mountains, seen by no one. *(cheap and invisible; you will learn the hard way, in contact.)*


@forjar_cuba
face-image: img/training.jpg
on-arrival: {! Q.f_entreno="cuba"; Q.f_bayo=1; Q.f_forjado=1; Q.f_phase="marcha"; Q.f_parque+=18; Q.f_moral+=12; Q.inteligencia+=6; Q.f_hombres+=4; Q.disciplina=(Q.disciplina||65)+8; Q.expediente+=8; Q.time+=2; !}

They fly out through Mexico City with false papers, and what waits for them in Cuba is the old man himself: Alberto Bayo — the one-eyed captain out of Spain and Morocco who trained eighty seasick exiles at a ranch in Chalco in 1956, and who is now a general of the Republic those exiles built, still teaching from his own *150 preguntas a un guerrillero.* The men who come back four months later can strip a rifle blind, lay an ambush that works, and turn a cache into a campaign — and they carry the through-line from the Sierra Maestra to this one in their hands.

It is a different band than the one that left. The DFS, which counted the departures at the airport, is already a step closer than you would like. Skill was bought. Anonymity was the price.

- @root: Al monte. Continuar.

@forjar_maestro
face-image: img/workingwithelpueblo.jpg
on-arrival: {! Q.f_entreno="maestro"; Q.f_forjado=1; Q.f_phase="marcha"; Q.apoyo_popular+=14; Q.f_hombres+=6; Q.f_comida+=10; Q.f_parque-=4; Q.sup_peasants+=4; !}

You do it the way Lucio actually did it: as a teacher, not a commander. Months of assemblies, of settling water disputes and marking the caciques' abuses, of being *of* Atoyac and not merely armed near it. When the guns finally come out, the sierra is already yours in the only way that matters — the villages will lie to a lieutenant to protect you. It is the deepest water a foco can start with. It is also the slowest, and the army is not waiting.

- @root: Al monte. Continuar.

@forjar_solos
on-arrival: {! Q.f_entreno="solos"; Q.f_forjado=1; Q.f_phase="marcha"; Q.f_moral+=4; !}

No school, no sponsor, no papers to be counted. You train yourselves in the mountains with what you have, and you will learn the rest the only other way it is taught: in contact, at a cost. Invisible, for now. Green, for now. The sierra is a hard teacher and it grades in blood.

- @root: Al monte. Continuar.

# =====================================================================
# PHASE 1 — LA MARCHA. Reached each month via the "La columna" card. One action per month:
# move (deeper/toward the coast), work the base, or act. Then the month turns (post_event).
# =====================================================================
@marcha
title: La columna
card-image: img/cards/columna_movil.jpg
subtitle: Move, scout, and slip the army across the Guerrero sierra
view-if: banda = "sierra" and f_forjado = 1 and f_phase = "marcha"
is-card: true
frequency: 100
max-visits: 400
tags: laguerra

= La columna en marcha

The column holds **[? if col_nodo = "atoyac" : Atoyac de Álvarez — the gateway town where the sierra meets the road ?][? if col_nodo = "coyuca" : Coyuca de Benítez — the coast, thick with people and garrison ?][? if col_nodo = "acapulco" : the edge of Acapulco — the port, the deepest garrison in the state ?][? if col_nodo = "sanvicente" : San Vicente de Benítez — the lower sierra, coffee country ?][? if col_nodo = "elquemado" : El Quemado — sierra proper, the village the army will punish for you ?][? if col_nodo = "elporvenir" : El Porvenir — a high side-trail few soldiers know ?][? if col_nodo = "riochiquito" : Río Chiquito — the deep sierra, the heart of the zone ?][? if col_nodo = "elotatal" : El Otatal — the deepest finca, where the maps run out ?]**.

Column: **[+ f_hombres : entero +]** fighters · comida **[+ f_comida : entero +]** · parque **[+ f_parque : entero +]** · moral **[+ f_moral : entero +]** · el agua **[+ apoyo_popular : entero +]**. Ring: **[+ f_cerco : entero +]**/100. **Puntos de acción: [+ acc_pts +]/[+ acc_max +].** [? if f_cerco >= 70 : *The ring is closing — move or break it.* ?][? if f_comida < 25 : *The men are hungry.* ?][? if acc_pts <= 0 : *No points left — end the month.* ?]

*Las órdenes salen por los mazos: **Movimiento**, **Combate**, **El pueblo** y **Política**. Cada acción cuesta puntos; cuando se acaben, termina el mes.*

- @fin_mes: **Terminar el mes.** Pasar al siguiente; los puntos de acción se reponen.

@cat_movimiento
new-page: true
is-card: true
frequency: 100
max-visits: 400
view-if: banda = "sierra" and f_forjado = 1 and f_phase = "marcha"
tags: fmovimiento
card-image: img/countryside2.jpg
title: Movimiento
subtitle: Mover la columna, reconocer, flanquear

= Movimiento

**El cerco: [+ f_cerco : entero +]/100** — the ring the army is closing around you. [? if f_cerco >= 70 : *It is nearly shut: move, or it closes on you.* ?][? if f_cerco < 30 : *Loose — you are not where they are looking.* ?] Comida **[+ f_comida : entero +]** (each move eats 4). **Puntos: [+ acc_pts +]/[+ acc_max +]**.

[? if f_campamento = 1 : **El campamento base** está en [? if camp_nodo = "atoyac" : Atoyac ?][? if camp_nodo = "coyuca" : Coyuca ?][? if camp_nodo = "sanvicente" : San Vicente ?][? if camp_nodo = "elquemado" : El Quemado ?][? if camp_nodo = "elporvenir" : El Porvenir ?][? if camp_nodo = "riochiquito" : Río Chiquito ?][? if camp_nodo = "elotatal" : El Otatal ?] (nivel [+ camp_nivel +]/3) — comida, hospital y cache. *Volver* para comer, curar y rearmar. ?][? if f_campamento = 0 : *Sin campamento base: la columna carga todo lo que tiene y los heridos van con ella.* ?]

*Moving to cold ground (low army) LOOSENS the ring; walking into a garrison tightens it and costs blood. A village's army number is hidden until you **Reconocer** it — scouting is how you flank instead of stumbling.*

**La carretera y la vereda.** The army moves on the road, because everything it owns has wheels under it: the coast highway through Acapulco, Coyuca and Atoyac, the valley road up to San Vicente, and the logging track to El Quemado. That is the whole of the country it can reach. **El Porvenir, Río Chiquito and El Otatal have no road into them at all** — above the last truck, the sierra is yours, and a column that moves by *vereda* is a column the formations cannot follow. [? if caz_alta = 1 : *— except that the Cazadores walk. They are on the paths now, and the high country is no longer a sanctuary.* ?][? if aid_estado = "listo" : **El alijo espera en [? if aid_nodo = "coyuca" : Coyuca ?][? if aid_nodo = "atoyac" : Atoyac ?][? if aid_nodo = "riochiquito" : Río Chiquito ?][? if aid_nodo = "elporvenir" : El Porvenir ?] — [+ aid_vence +] meses.** ?]

- @go_atoyac: → **Atoyac** *(carretera)*[? if sn_atoyac = 1 : (ejército [+ gn_atoyac +]) ?].
- @go_coyuca: → **Coyuca** *(carretera)*[? if sn_coyuca = 1 : (ejército [+ gn_coyuca +]) ?].
- @go_acapulco: → **Acapulco** *(carretera)*[? if sn_acapulco = 1 : (ejército [+ gn_acapulco +]) ?].
- @go_sanvicente: → **San Vicente** *(carretera)*[? if sn_sanvicente = 1 : (ejército [+ gn_sanvicente +]) ?].
- @go_elquemado: → **El Quemado** *(brecha)*[? if sn_elquemado = 1 : (ejército [+ gn_elquemado +]) ?].
- @go_elporvenir: → **El Porvenir** *(vereda — sin carretera)*[? if sn_elporvenir = 1 : (ejército [+ gn_elporvenir +]) ?].
- @go_riochiquito: → **Río Chiquito** *(vereda — sin carretera)*[? if sn_riochiquito = 1 : (ejército [+ gn_riochiquito +]) ?].
- @go_elotatal: → **El Otatal** *(vereda — donde acaban los mapas)*[? if sn_elotatal = 1 : (ejército [+ gn_elotatal +]) ?].
- @m_reconocer: **Reconocer.** Scout the neighbouring villages — reveal the army units, and let the guides find the coldest way through. *(1 pt)*
- @m_forzada: **Marcha forzada.** A night march to the coldest ground within reach — break contact hard. *(2 pts; big ring drop; costs comida + moral)*
- @m_acampar: **Acampar.** Make a night camp — rest, forage, mend. *(1 pt; +moral +comida; a static camp can be found)*
- @m_campamento: **Establecer el campamento base.**[? if f_campamento = 1 : *(already built)* ?] A permanent camp in the deep sierra — stores, a hospital, a school. *(2 pts; needs deep ground and real water)*
- @m_mejorar: **Mejorar el campamento.** Deepen the base — more stores, a better hospital, a school for the villages. *(1 pt; needs the camp)*
- @m_volver_campo: **Volver al campamento.** March home to the base — eat, heal, rearm. *(1 pt)*
- @return: **Volver.** Guardar la carta y elegir otra cosa este mes.
- @fin_mes: **Terminar el mes.** Los puntos de acción se reponen.

@cat_combate
new-page: true
is-card: true
frequency: 100
max-visits: 400
view-if: banda = "sierra" and f_forjado = 1 and f_phase = "marcha"
