title: Combate
subtitle: Desgastar al ejército que te caza
face-image: img/guerilla assualt2.jpg

= Combate

**Desgaste del ejército: [+ f_desgaste : entero +]/100** — the only road to victory. [? if f_desgaste >= 50 : *The army is hollow: at 50+, with a real column and deep water, **El momento** opens — the chance to take Chilpancingo.* ?][? if f_desgaste < 50 : *Wear it down. At 50 the chance to take a capital becomes possible.* ?]

[+ f_hombres : entero +] fighters · parque **[+ f_parque : entero +]** (an ambush costs 12) · moral **[+ f_moral : entero +]** · cerco **[+ f_cerco : entero +]**. **Puntos: [+ acc_pts +]/[+ acc_max +]**.

*Every blow wears the army AND tightens the ring. Morale decides whether an ambush is a corrido or a funeral; the garrison where you strike gets thinner.*

- @m_emboscar: **Emboscar.** Hit an army patrol on ground you chose. *(2 pts)*
- @c_sabotaje: **Sabotaje.** Blow a bridge, a rail, a power line — cheap damage that wears the army and the state. *(1 pt; +desgaste; +heat)*
- @c_convoy: **Golpe a un convoy.** Hit an army supply convoy for its rations and ammunition. *(2 pts; +parque +comida if it works; risky, +ring)*
- @return: **Volver.** Guardar la carta y elegir otra cosa este mes.
- @fin_mes: **Terminar el mes.** Los puntos de acción se reponen.

@cat_pueblo
new-page: true
is-card: true
frequency: 100
max-visits: 400
view-if: banda = "sierra" and f_forjado = 1 and f_phase = "marcha"
tags: fpueblo
card-image: img/elpueblo.jpg
title: El pueblo y las comunicaciones
subtitle: Ganar el agua — y hablarle al mundo por fuera del cerco
face-image: img/workingwithelpueblo.jpg

= El pueblo

**El agua (apoyo popular): [+ apoyo_popular : entero +]/100** — the sea the column swims in. [? if apoyo_popular >= 55 : *Deep: the villages warn you before the army arrives, the ring loosens, and an encirclement can be slipped on trust alone.* ?][? if apoyo_popular >= 30 and apoyo_popular < 55 : *Shallow: sympathy, but not yet shelter. Below 55 the people cannot save a surrounded column.* ?][? if apoyo_popular < 30 : ***Drying up.** The people inform. The Colonel's map fills itself and one morning the ring is already closed.* ?]

**El techo: [+ apoyo_techo +]/100** — as far as this sierra will ever go with you. Mexico is a liberal democracy *on paper*, and that is the regime's sharpest weapon: the PRI gave the land, it runs the ejido and the CNC and the credit, it holds elections, and it speaks in the Revolution's own voice. Most campesinos are not waiting for you. Past the techo, support drains back to the Party no matter how many assemblies you hold.

*The ceiling RISES when the regime discredits itself — its dead on the memorial, its lost legitimacy — and when you visibly govern better than it does (the zone, the médico, the school). It FALLS when the state buys the countryside back with reparto and credit, when the advisors' civic action starts, and when your own ajusticiamientos frighten people.*

Comida **[+ f_comida : entero +]** · hombres **[+ f_hombres : entero +]** · el cerco **[+ f_cerco : entero +]**/100 · **Puntos: [+ acc_pts +]/[+ acc_max +]**. [? if f_pueblo_mes >= 1 : Ya trabajaste el pueblo este mes — cada regreso rinde la mitad y aprieta el cerco mucho más. ?]

*Organizar es quedarse quieto. Hacerlo dos veces en un mes rinde la mitad y sube el cerco de golpe; hacerlo tres es invitar al cerco completo.*

- @m_base: **Trabajar la base.** Work the water here — assemblies, the mass line, the clinic. *(1 pt)*
- @p_asamblea: **La asamblea.** Let the village govern in the open — the people's justice, the common field. *(1 pt; +apoyo, +the movement's legitimacy)*
- @pue_escuela: **La escuela y la clínica.** Literacy circles and the médico's rounds — govern, don't just fight. *(1 pt; +apoyo, +the zone governed)*
- @return: **Volver.** Guardar la carta y elegir otra cosa este mes.
- @fin_mes: **Terminar el mes.** Los puntos de acción se reponen.


