@go_resolve
new-page: true
on-arrival: {! var g=Q['gn_'+Q.col_nodo]||0; Q.move_contact=0; Q.move_cold=0; Q.move_maul=0;
if(g>=35){
  Q.move_contact=1;
  var _def=g*1.05;
  var _atk=(Q.f_hombres||0)*1.1+(Q.f_moral||0)*0.35+(Q.disciplina||65)*0.15+((Q.apoyo_popular||0)>=55?10:0);
  if(_atk < _def){
    Q.move_maul=1;
    var _loss=Math.round(2+(_def-_atk)/12); if(_loss>8){_loss=8;}
    Q.f_hombres-=_loss; Q.f_bajas+=_loss; Q.memorial=(Q.memorial||0)+1;
    Q.f_moral-=10; Q.f_parque-=4; Q.f_cerco+=26;
  } else { Q.f_hombres-=1; Q.f_bajas+=1; Q.f_moral-=3; Q.f_cerco+=14; }
} else if(g<18){ Q.move_cold=1; Q.f_cerco-=8; }
else { Q.f_cerco+=4; }
if(Q.f_cerco<0){Q.f_cerco=0;} if(Q.f_cerco>100){Q.f_cerco=100;}
if(Q.f_parque<0){Q.f_parque=0;} if(Q.f_hombres<0){Q.f_hombres=0;}
Q.f_comida-=4; if(Q.f_comida<0){Q.f_comida=0;}
if(Q.f_hombres<=0){Q.f_fin_foco=1;Q.members=0;} !}

The column crosses to [? if col_nodo = "atoyac" : Atoyac ?][? if col_nodo = "coyuca" : Coyuca ?][? if col_nodo = "acapulco" : the edge of Acapulco ?][? if col_nodo = "sanvicente" : San Vicente ?][? if col_nodo = "elquemado" : El Quemado ?][? if col_nodo = "elporvenir" : El Porvenir ?][? if col_nodo = "riochiquito" : Río Chiquito ?][? if col_nodo = "elotatal" : El Otatal ?].[? if move_maul = 1 :  **And walks straight into a garrison far stronger than the column.** They are dug in, they have the road and the radio, and the firefight is not a battle but a scramble to get out of one — you break contact leaving dead on ground you chose badly, the parque half spent, the ring slamming shut behind you. This is how columns die: not to a plan, but to a commander who moved without knowing what was waiting. ?][? if move_contact = 1 and move_maul = 0 :  There are soldiers here. You trade fire on the way through, pay for the crossing, and the ring tightens around a column the army has now definitely located. ?][? if move_cold = 1 :  Cold ground — no garrison in it. The column melts into country the soldiers are not watching, and the ring loosens behind you. ?]

- @cat_movimiento: Continuar.

@m_reconocer
choose-if: acc_pts >= 1
on-arrival: {! Q.acc_pts-=1; var adj={atoyac:['coyuca','sanvicente','elquemado'],coyuca:['atoyac','acapulco','sanvicente'],acapulco:['coyuca'],sanvicente:['atoyac','coyuca','elquemado','elporvenir'],elquemado:['atoyac','sanvicente','riochiquito'],elporvenir:['sanvicente','riochiquito'],riochiquito:['elquemado','elporvenir','elotatal'],elotatal:['riochiquito']}; var ns=adj[Q.col_nodo]||[]; Q['sn_'+Q.col_nodo]=1; for(var i=0;i<ns.length;i++){ Q['sn_'+ns[i]]=1; } if(Q.apoyo_popular>=45){ var hot='',hv=-1; for(var j=0;j<ns.length;j++){ if((Q['gn_'+ns[j]]||0)>hv){hv=Q['gn_'+ns[j]]||0;hot=ns[j];} } if(hot&&hv>=25){ Q['gn_'+hot]=hv-12; } } Q.inteligencia+=1; !}

The scouts go out, and the guides — the ones born in these draws — go with them. By nightfall you know it: which villages the army sits in, which trails it watches, and which cold way around the garrisons only people who grew up here would know. [? if apoyo_popular >= 45 : The guides find a vereda past the worst of it — a way to flank the heaviest unit that the army does not know exists. ?][? if apoyo_popular < 45 : The picture is clearer now, though without deeper trust in these villages the guides will only show you so much. ?] Knowing where the enemy is *not* is worth more than knowing where it is.

- @cat_movimiento: Continuar.

@m_base
choose-if: acc_pts >= 1
on-arrival: {! Q.acc_pts-=1; Q.f_pueblo_mes=(Q.f_pueblo_mes||0)+1; var _n=Q.f_pueblo_mes; var _h=Math.max(0,(Q.apoyo_techo||55)-(Q.apoyo_popular||0)); Q.apoyo_popular+=Math.min(5,_h*0.30)/_n; Q.f_comida+=4; Q.f_hombres+=1; Q.sup_peasants+=2; Q.f_cerco+=4+(_n-1)*11; if(Q.f_cerco>100){Q.f_cerco=100;} !}

You put the rifles down and do the unglamorous work that is the whole war: the assembly held, the dispute settled, the cacique's abuse marked and answered, the clinic and the literacy circle. The water rises here — a little more of the sierra that will hide you, feed you, and lie for you. But a column that sits still can be found, and somewhere a lieutenant notes that you have not moved.

- @cat_pueblo: Continuar.

@m_emboscar
choose-if: acc_pts >= 2 and f_parque >= 12
unavailable-subtitle: An ambush costs 2 action points and at least 12 parque.
on-arrival: {! Q.acc_pts-=2; Q.f_parque-=12; var g=Q['gn_'+Q.col_nodo]||0; var _r=(Q.f_hombres*0.5)+(Q.f_moral*0.3)+(Q.apoyo_popular*0.3)-(g*0.3)-(Q.f_cerco*0.2)+(Math.random()*40-15); if(_r>=25){Q.f_desgaste+=10;Q.f_parque+=8;Q.f_moral+=8;Q.leyenda=(Q.leyenda||0)+2;Q.legitimidad_regimen-=2;if(g>0){Q['gn_'+Q.col_nodo]=g-8;}}else if(_r>=5){Q.f_desgaste+=5;Q.f_moral+=2;Q.f_hombres-=1;}else{Q.f_hombres-=3;Q.f_moral-=8;Q.f_bajas+=3;Q.memorial=(Q.memorial||0)+1;} Q.f_cerco+=18; if(Q.f_cerco>100){Q.f_cerco=100;} Q.represion+=2; !}

You choose the ground — a defile, a bridge, a bend where trucks must slow — and spend the parque you cannot easily replace. [? if f_moral >= 66 : It goes the way the corridos need it: the patrol is broken, its rifles yours, and the garrison here is a little thinner for it. ?][? if f_moral < 66 and f_moral >= 40 : It works, barely, and costs more than the manual promised — a man down, the column melting back into the trees carrying its wounded. ?][? if f_moral < 40 : It was a trap inside your trap; the column fights out of a ring it should have seen, and leaves people on the mountain. ?] Either way the army now knows where you are, and the ring slams tighter.

- @cat_combate: Continuar.

@fin_mes
new-page: true
on-arrival: month_actions = 1
go-to: root

@m_forzada
choose-if: acc_pts >= 2
unavailable-subtitle: A forced march costs 2 action points.
on-arrival: {! Q.acc_pts-=2; var _adj={atoyac:['coyuca','sanvicente','elquemado'],coyuca:['atoyac','acapulco','sanvicente'],acapulco:['coyuca'],sanvicente:['atoyac','coyuca','elquemado','elporvenir'],elquemado:['atoyac','sanvicente','riochiquito'],elporvenir:['sanvicente','riochiquito'],riochiquito:['elquemado','elporvenir','elotatal'],elotatal:['riochiquito']}; var _ns=_adj[Q.col_nodo]||[]; var _cold='',_cv=999; for(var _i=0;_i<_ns.length;_i++){ var _g=Q['gn_'+_ns[_i]]||0; if(_g<_cv){_cv=_g;_cold=_ns[_i];} } if(_cold){Q.col_nodo=_cold;Q['sn_'+_cold]=1;} Q.f_cerco-=30; if(Q.f_cerco<0){Q.f_cerco=0;} Q.f_comida-=10; if(Q.f_comida<0){Q.f_comida=0;} Q.f_moral-=4; !}

You move all night, hard, over ground the army cannot follow in the dark, and by dawn the column is on the coldest ridge within reach and the ring is a memory behind you. It costs the men their legs and a chunk of the rations, and morale always dips on a march that feels like flight — but breaking contact clean is worth more than any of it. The oldest guerrilla trick: be somewhere else by morning.

- @cat_movimiento: Continuar.

@m_acampar
choose-if: acc_pts >= 1
on-arrival: {! Q.acc_pts-=1; Q.f_moral+=8; Q.f_comida+=8; Q.f_hombres+=1; Q.f_cerco+=8; if(Q.f_cerco>100){Q.f_cerco=100;} !}

You make a real camp for once — hammocks strung, a proper fire, the wounded tended, the hunters out, a night's true sleep. The column comes back to itself: morale rises, the pot fills, a straggler or two rejoins. But a camp is a fixed place, and fixed places get found; every day you stay, the odds the army stumbles onto you climb. Rest is a weapon and a risk, like everything else up here.

- @cat_movimiento: Continuar.

@c_sabotaje
choose-if: acc_pts >= 1
on-arrival: {! Q.acc_pts-=1; Q.f_desgaste+=6; Q.legitimidad_regimen-=1; Q.f_cerco+=6; if(Q.f_cerco>100){Q.f_cerco=100;} Q.leyenda=(Q.leyenda||0)+1; Q.represion+=1; !}

A charge on a bridge pylon, a rail line cut, a power tower dropped across a road — cheap, deniable, and out of all proportion to its cost in the disruption it causes. It ties down troops on guard duty, embarrasses the state's promise of order, and wears the army's patience without risking the column in a firefight. Death by a thousand cuts is the foco's real arithmetic.

- @cat_combate: Continuar.

@c_convoy
choose-if: acc_pts >= 2
unavailable-subtitle: Hitting a convoy costs 2 action points.
on-arrival: {! Q.acc_pts-=2; var _r=(Q.f_hombres*0.5)+(Q.f_moral*0.3)+(Q.apoyo_popular*0.2)-45+(Math.random()*35-14); if(_r>=0){Q.f_parque+=12;Q.f_comida+=16;Q.f_desgaste+=6;Q.f_moral+=4;}else{Q.f_hombres-=3;Q.f_moral-=6;Q.f_bajas+=3;Q.memorial=(Q.memorial||0)+1;Q.f_comida+=6;} Q.f_cerco+=14; if(Q.f_cerco>100){Q.f_cerco=100;} !}

You take the column's supper from the army's own trucks. [? if f_moral >= 50 : It goes clean — the convoy is stripped of its rations and ammunition, and the sierra eats the enemy's food that night, which does something to a hungry band that no speech can. ?][? if f_moral < 50 : It goes badly — the escort was heavier than the intelligence promised, and you pull off the road with some of it and fewer of your own. ?] The army knows exactly where its supplies went, and comes looking.

- @cat_combate: Continuar.

@p_asamblea
choose-if: acc_pts >= 1
on-arrival: {! Q.acc_pts-=1; Q.f_pueblo_mes=(Q.f_pueblo_mes||0)+1; var _n=Q.f_pueblo_mes; var _h=Math.max(0,(Q.apoyo_techo||55)-(Q.apoyo_popular||0)); Q.apoyo_popular+=Math.min(4,_h*0.26)/_n; Q.f_cerco+=4+(_n-1)*11; if(Q.f_cerco>100){Q.f_cerco=100;} Q.sup_peasants=(Q.sup_peasants||0)+3; Q.zona_gobernada=1; Q.legitimidad_regimen-=1; !}

You call the whole village together and let it govern itself in the open — disputes heard, the common field decided, the cacique's abuses named and answered by the people rather than the gun. It is the mass line made concrete, and it wins the deepest kind of water: not fear, not even gratitude, but the sense that where the guerrilla is, the people rule themselves. That is a thing no army can bomb and no cacique can buy back.

- @cat_pueblo: Continuar.

@p_radio
choose-if: acc_pts >= 1
on-arrival: {! Q.acc_pts-=1; Q.apoyo_popular+=5; Q.leyenda=(Q.leyenda||0)+3; Q.legitimidad_regimen-=3; Q.pol_intl+=4; Q.expediente=(Q.expediente||0)+4; Q.estado_intel=(Q.estado_intel||0)+2; Q.f_cerco+=4; if(Q.f_cerco>100){Q.f_cerco=100;} !}

For an hour the sierra has a voice: a clandestine transmitter, a communiqué read into a hundred thousand kitchens across the state, the government's official silence broken by the one thing it cannot jam fast enough. It is armed propaganda at its purest — proof, in every home with a radio, that the guerrilla exists, that it speaks, that the state does not control even the air. It also gives the army a signal to triangulate, and the file a new page. Worth it, for a voice.

- @cat_politica: Continuar.

@p_enlace
choose-if: acc_pts >= 2
unavailable-subtitle: Opening an external channel costs 2 action points.
on-arrival: {! Q.acc_pts-=2; Q.f_parque+=10; Q.inteligencia+=5; Q.pol_intl+=8; if(Q.pol_intl>100){Q.pol_intl=100;} Q.internac_armada=(Q.internac_armada||0)+1; Q.expediente=(Q.expediente||0)+6; Q.apoyo_popular+=2; !}

You open the channel the sierra can never open for itself — a line to Havana, to the solidarity networks that move weapons, papers, medicine and word across borders the state thinks it controls. It brings the column things the mountain does not grow: real matériel, real intelligence, the knowledge that the war has friends. It also runs a thread from your camp to a safehouse to a foreign embassy, and threads like that are exactly what the DFS spends its life pulling. The synthesis Che preached — and the exposure he paid for.

- @cat_politica: Continuar.

@p_comunicado
choose-if: acc_pts >= 1
on-arrival: {! Q.acc_pts-=1; Q.legitimidad_regimen-=4; Q.apoyo_popular+=2; Q.pol_intl+=6; if(Q.pol_intl>100){Q.pol_intl=100;} Q.expediente=(Q.expediente||0)+3; Q.leyenda=(Q.leyenda||0)+1; !}

You get the movement's word past the censor and into a national daily — a manifesto, a denunciation of a massacre the government swears never happened, the names of the disappeared printed where the whole country reads them. It costs the regime something it guards more jealously than any garrison: the story. A state that cannot control the narrative of its own dirty war is a state already losing it, and every column that ever fought learned that the communiqué can wound where the rifle cannot reach.

- @cat_politica: Continuar.

@cat_politica
new-page: true
is-card: true
frequency: 100
max-visits: 400
view-if: banda = "sierra" and f_forjado = 1 and f_phase = "marcha"
tags: fpolitica
card-image: img/pcm.jpg
title: Política
subtitle: Hablarle al mundo por fuera del cerco — el Partido, la prensa, la solidaridad

= Política y comunicaciones

**El Partido (PCM): [+ pol_pcm : entero +]/100** — political cover, cadre and lawyers, and the only people who can turn a won war into power. [? if pol_pcm >= 55 : *They vouch for you: the file grows slower and a settlement is possible.* ?][? if pol_pcm < 20 : *They will not touch you. Win or lose, you will do it alone.* ?]

**Testigos internacionales: [+ pol_intl : entero +]/100** — the world watching. [? if pol_intl >= 45 : *A watched state cannot massacre freely: repression is restrained and Washington hesitates.* ?][? if pol_intl < 20 : *Nobody outside is looking. What happens in the sierra stays buried there.* ?]

Legitimidad del régimen **[+ legitimidad_regimen : entero +]** · leyenda **[+ leyenda : entero +]** · expediente **[+ expediente : entero +]**. **Puntos: [+ acc_pts +]/[+ acc_max +]**.

*A guerrilla sealed inside its own encirclement dies there — militarily or politically. These two numbers decide whether a victory can be cashed, and whether a defeat is survivable.*

- @p_radio: **Radio guerrillera.** Broadcast from the sierra — a clandestine transmitter the whole state can hear. *(1 pt; +apoyo +leyenda, −legitimidad; the army triangulates the signal)*
- @p_comunicado: **Comunicado a la prensa.** Get the movement's word past the censor into a national daily. *(1 pt; −legitimidad; +expediente)*
- @pol_pcm: **Hablar con el PCM.** Open a channel to the Party — legality, cadre, and the argument over the gun. *(1 pt; +political cover, +unity; the orthodox will demand a price)*
- @p_enlace: **Enlace exterior.** A channel to Cuba and the international solidarity networks. *(2 pts; +parque +inteligencia; +the file on you)*
- @p_pedir: **Pedir apoyo material por radio.** Ask Havana or Moscow for weapons, money or cadre. *(2 pts; it takes months and it has to be collected in person)*
- @p_recoger: **Recoger el alijo.** [? if aid_nodo = col_nodo : It is here. Go and get it. ?][? if aid_nodo != col_nodo : The shipment is waiting elsewhere — the column has to march to it. ?] *(1 pt)*
- @pol_intl: **Solidaridad internacional.** Denounce the dirty war abroad — exiles, journalists, the tricontinental networks. *(1 pt; −legitimidad abroad, protects prisoners; +expediente)*
- @return: **Volver.** Guardar la carta y elegir otra cosa este mes.
- @fin_mes: **Terminar el mes.** Los puntos de acción se reponen.

# =====================================================================
# EL APOYO EXTERIOR: you can ask. It arrives at the speed of ships, embassies and politics,
# it is put down in one specific place, and somebody has to walk there and carry it out.
# =====================================================================
@p_pedir
new-page: true
face-image: img/international.jpg
view-if: aid_estado = ""
choose-if: acc_pts >= 2 and (pol_intl >= 20 or pol_pcm >= 25)
unavailable-subtitle: Asking a foreign state for weapons costs 2 action points and requires somebody out there who already takes your calls — 20 international witnesses or 25 with the Party.
on-arrival: {! Q.acc_pts-=2; !}

= La radio, de madrugada

Twice a month, at an hour agreed a year ago, a set in a hut in the sierra talks to a set somewhere that is not in Mexico. It is the strangest twenty minutes of the war: forty people eating boiled roots in a country the government says contains no guerrillas, and a voice from a world in which this is a *front*, a chapter in something continental, a line item.

You can ask. The asking is the easy part. Everything after it happens on a timescale that has nothing to do with your hunger.

- @p_ped_cuba: **La Habana.** They know how to do this — they have done it for a decade. Weapons, and people trained to use them. *(faster; the Americans notice)*
- @p_ped_urss: **Moscú, por el Partido.** Money rather than rifles, through channels so respectable they are almost legal. *(slower; needs the Party; the Party gets a say)*
- @cat_politica: No. A guerrilla that waits on a ship is not a guerrilla. Volver.

@p_ped_cuba
new-page: true
choose-if: pol_intl >= 20
unavailable-subtitle: Havana answers movements the world has heard of. It has not heard of you.
on-arrival: {! Q.aid_fuente="cuba"; !}

= Lo que Cuba puede mandar

The answer comes back in four days, which is astonishingly fast, and it is yes, and then it is a series of questions about geography that make you realize the person on the other end has done this before and is thinking about a coastline.

- @p_ped_c_mar: **Por mar.** A fishing boat onto the Guerrero coast — weapons and ammunition in quantity. *(lands near the road, where the garrisons are)*
- @p_ped_c_aire: **Por aire.** A night drop into the deep sierra — less tonnage, and two instructors with it. *(lands where only you can walk; a smaller load)*

@p_ped_c_mar
go-to: foco.p_ped_fin
on-arrival: {! Q.aid_via="mar"; Q.aid_tipo="armas"; Q.aid_eta=4; !}

@p_ped_c_aire
go-to: foco.p_ped_fin
on-arrival: {! Q.aid_via="aire"; Q.aid_tipo="cuadros"; Q.aid_eta=5; !}

@p_ped_urss
new-page: true
choose-if: pol_pcm >= 25
unavailable-subtitle: Moscow talks to Communist Parties, not to columns. Without the PCM vouching for you there is no channel at all.
on-arrival: {! Q.aid_fuente="urss"; !}

= Lo que Moscú puede mandar

The answer takes eleven weeks and arrives through three intermediaries, one of whom is a cultural attaché, and it is a qualified and heavily conditioned yes that has clearly been argued about by people in a building.

They will not send rifles to an armed group in a country with which they have correct diplomatic relations and a trade delegation. They will send money, laundered so thoroughly it will arrive looking like a remittance, and they will expect the Party to have a say in what it buys.

- @p_ped_u_dinero: Take it. Money buys rifles in Mexico as well as anywhere else. *(slow; the PCM's hand on the tiller)*

@p_ped_u_dinero
go-to: foco.p_ped_fin
on-arrival: {! Q.aid_via="mar"; Q.aid_tipo="dinero"; Q.aid_eta=7; Q.pol_pcm=(Q.pol_pcm||0)+6; Q.linea_guerra=(Q.linea_guerra||0)-3; !}

@p_ped_fin
new-page: true
on-arrival: {! Q.aid_estado="pedido"; Q.aid_last=Q.time; Q.pol_intl=(Q.pol_intl||0)+4; Q.expediente=(Q.expediente||0)+5; Q.estado_intel=(Q.estado_intel||0)+3; !}

= Ahora se espera

The request is made and now the war has a second clock running in it that you do not control and cannot hurry.

[? if aid_via = "mar" : Somewhere a boat has to be found, and loaded, and moved across the Caribbean and around the Yucatán, and brought onto a coast that has a naval station on it. ?][? if aid_via = "aire" : Somewhere an aircraft has to be prepared for a route that crosses two national airspaces at night in order to put a load into a mountain valley from three hundred feet. ?]

It will not arrive when you need it. It will arrive when it arrives, in a place chosen by someone looking at a chart, and the column will have to be *there* — which means that at some point in the next few months you will have to march the whole band across the state on a schedule set by a stranger, whatever else is happening.

Half the guerrilla wars of the century have a chapter like this in them. Most of those chapters end badly.

- @root: Continuar.

@p_recoger
new-page: true
face-image: img/cards/expropiacion.jpg
view-if: aid_estado = "listo"
choose-if: acc_pts >= 1 and aid_nodo = col_nodo
unavailable-subtitle: The shipment is not on this ground. The column has to march to it — and the deadline does not move.
on-arrival: {!
Q.acc_pts-=1;
var _g=Q['gn_'+Q.col_nodo]||0, _caz=((Q.ej4_nodo||"")===Q.col_nodo)?1:0;
var _r=(Q.f_hombres||0)*0.7+(Q.apoyo_popular||0)*0.5+(Q.disciplina||65)*0.3-_g*0.9-_caz*25-40+(Math.random()*36-14);
Q.ch_res=(_r>=10)?"bien":((_r>=-14)?"parcial":"mal");
if(Q.ch_res!=="mal"){
  var _k=(Q.ch_res==="bien")?1:0.45;
  if(Q.aid_tipo==="armas"){ Q.f_parque+=Math.round(40*_k); Q.f_hombres+=Math.round(2*_k); }
  if(Q.aid_tipo==="cuadros"){ Q.f_parque+=Math.round(16*_k); Q.disciplina=(Q.disciplina||65)+Math.round(10*_k); Q.f_moral+=Math.round(12*_k); Q.f_hombres+=Math.round(4*_k); Q.che_advisor=1; }
  if(Q.aid_tipo==="dinero"){ Q.funds=(Q.funds||0)+Math.round(45*_k); Q.f_comida+=Math.round(20*_k); Q.f_parque+=Math.round(12*_k); }
